      "notes": "PIN_LED — this board's TFT backlight control line (NOT a general status LED; confirmed via this board's own pins_arduino.h author comment \"backlight, weird but why not?\" plus Adafruit/Hackster.io descriptions of an integrated 240x240 TFT display). led_high tagged on the same digitalWrite(LED_BUILTIN, HIGH)-idiom basis used repo-wide for arduino-pico PIN_LED pins; active polarity not independently vendor-confirmed for this specific board — see notes.txt."
